# Secrets. Several images `COPY . .` the whole build context, so any of these
# present in a real checkout would otherwise be baked into the image layers.
# Docker anchors patterns at the context root (no .gitignore-style basename
# matching), hence the `**/` prefixes. `*` also matches a leading dot.
# Env files and their backups: .env, .env.local, .vali.env, .trainer.env,
# .vali.env.bak.20261027, prod.env, ...
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
# Keys, certificates and credential stores.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.ssh
**/.git-credentials
**/.netrc
**/.pgpass
**/.aws
**/.docker/config.json
**/.huggingface/token
# Bittensor wallets/hotkeys.
**/.bittensor
**/wallets
**/*_keys.encrypted
